OL,3,GNEWSAFour charged with murder after
OL,4,Ababy stabbed to death
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men and two women have been charged
OL,7,Fwith murder after a baby girl was found
OL,8,Fstabbed to death at a house in
OL,9,FSheffield.
OL,11,FThe newborn was found at the property
OL,12,Fon Holywell Heights in the Wincobank
OL,13,Farea on Sunday morning, after police
OL,14,Fwere called to reports of concern for
OL,15,Fher safety.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
