OL,3,GNEWSAFour charged with murder after
OL,4,Ababy stabbed to death
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth Yorkshire Police said two men,
OL,7,Faged 19 and 38, and two women, aged 20
OL,8,Fand 37, had been charged with murder,
OL,9,Fcausing or allowing the death of a
OL,10,Fchild and perverting the course of
OL,11,Fjustice by taking steps to conceal the
OL,12,Fkilling of an infant.
OL,14,FA fifth person, a 15-year-old girl, has
OL,15,Falso been charged with perverting the
OL,16,Fcourse of justice.
